,"y":720,"w":1795,"h":48},{"text":"or grandchildren in school.","x":298,"y":785,"w":502,"h":40},{"text":"Our schools need:","x":296,"y":917,"w":337,"h":35},{"text":"• Great teachers","x":366,"y":985,"w":347,"h":32},{"text":"• Asafe environment for students and teachers","x":366,"y":1050,"w":936,"h":38},{"text":"• Strong programs in science, math, literacy, engineering and career technical education","x":363,"y":1117,"w":1707,"h":45},{"text":"Classrooms that build vocational, hands-on and problem-solving skills for today's and","x":432,"y":1181,"w":1612,"h":51},{"text":"tomorrow's careers","x":430,"y":1248,"w":373,"h":33},{"text":"Measure will meet all these goals, providing necessary school updates now and for","x":293,"y":1378,"w":1624,"h":49},{"text":"generations to come.","x":289,"y":1445,"w":401,"h":38},{"text":"Yes on","x":288,"y":1577,"w":118,"h":32},{"text":"to repair 60-year-old school facilities, including aging underground pipes that risk","x":477,"y":1578,"w":1539,"h":48},{"text":"sewer backups and expensive failures, leaky roofs, old plumbing, restrooms, windows and","x":288,"y":1641,"w":1701,"h":50},{"text":"doors. Hazardous materials like lead and asbestos must be removed where they're still found.","x":288,"y":1706,"w":1774,"h":52},{"text":"Yes on","x":286,"y":1840,"w":117,"h":32},{"text":"to upgrade wiring and tech infrastructure for up-to-date science, technology,","x":475,"y":1840,"w":1459,"h":51},{"text":"engineering, and math instruction.","x":286,"y":1907,"w":653,"h":39},{"text":"Yes on","x":284,"y":2038,"w":117,"h":31},{"text":"to restore shop classes and expand career technical education/ vocational programs.","x":472,"y":2039,"w":1608,"h":49},{"text":"to help our schools recruit and retain great teachers, who struggle with the high cost","x":472,"y":2170,"w":1607,"h":50},{"text":"Yes on","x":283,"y":2171,"w":117,"h":31},{"text":"of living in our area, by repurposing old administrative buildings for teacher and staff housing.","x":283,"y":2235,"w":1776,"h":53},{"text":"for essential security and fire safety upgrades, including fire alarms and emergency","x":470,"y":2367,"w":1573,"h":54},{"text":"Yes on","x":281,"y":2368,"w":118,"h":32},{"text":"communication systems.","x":282,"y":2434,"w":467,"h":41},{"text":"Vote Yes on","x":279,"y":2567,"w":220,"h":32},{"text":"to ensure local control and oversight over school improvement funds:","x":570,"y":2568,"w":1321,"h":47},{"text":"• Independent oversight, annual audits, and public spending disclosures","x":348,"y":2697,"w":1399,"h":49}]},{"page":8,"width":2436,"height":3156,"lines":[{"text":"Argument in Favor of Measure","x":892,"y":125,"w":594,"h":42},{"text":"e No funds for administrators' salaries or pensions","x":374,"y":265,"w":989,"h":41},{"text":"e No funds can be taken by State or Federal governments","x":372,"y":330,"w":1123,"h":43},{"text":"Join us: vote YES on","x":298,"y":463,"w":371,"h":34}]}]}
